id=gms_priv
name=GMS Privileged (bind-mount factory GMS into /product/priv-app)
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=workbuddy
description=Promotes the device's factory (OEM-signed) GMS packages (Play Store, GmsCore, GSF) to a privileged system location via a tmpfs bind-mount over /product/priv-app, and adds the privapp-permissions allowlist, so GSF can obtain READ_DEVICE_CONFIG and Google Play functions. No system partition writes (erofs read-only); pure VFS bind mount.
